30,2,1,talk,George,,It seems checking figures creates tension and asking for favors sours the mood. We need a system that minimizes both.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Recording every run is a time sink, and usage is heavily skewed toward weekends. A flexible system might be too costly in time.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The car is often left dirty or empty, and our weekly routines are constantly disrupted. We need more stability and accountability.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The fixed costs are 280,000 yen, but fuel payments are very uneven. A simple even split isn't reflecting the actual usage.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Minato,,"I saw that some people paid for way more fuel than others, and Saturdays are much busier than Tuesdays. That's not very fair.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, if recording runs takes too much time, perhaps a fixed allocation would be less stressful for everyone?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, that would certainly remove the need for constant calculation and the ""untangling"" I dislike.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Misaki, if we have fixed days, would that solve the issue of the car not being ready for those of us with weekly commitments?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"It might, but we still need to decide if the person using it more pays more, or if we stick to a flat fee.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Minato,,I think we should make sure the people who drive more pay for the fuel they use.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,George,,We must avoid a system where we feel we are accusing each other of cheating.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"A fixed day system is clean. No one has to ask for a favor if it's ""their day.""","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. Knowing the car is mine on a Tuesday morning would stop the anxiety of it being missing.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"But if one person has a day they never use, they are subsidizing the others. We need to balance fairness with peace.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Minato,,Is there a way to be fair without making people feel bad?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,George,,Let's look at the options. We need to balance the financial fairness Misaki wants with the peace of mind I'm looking for.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I prefer the option that requires the least amount of administrative work and coordination.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I just want to know the car is there and usable when I need it for my routine.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll support whatever prevents the most resentment over money and effort.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Minato,,I just want everyone to be happy and the numbers to be honest.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
