57,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Option B guarantees my weekly slots and removes the handover uncertainty. I vote for B.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option A is the most financially fair, but based on what George and Toshio said, it might cause too much friction. I'll vote B for peace.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option A seems the most honest about the money, but if everyone else likes B and it makes them happy, I'll vote B too.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
